    <details>
    <summary>Release notes</summary>
    <p><em>Sourced from <a
    href="https://github.com/jacoco/jacoco/releases">org.jacoco:jacoco-maven-plugin's
    releases</a>.</em></p>
    <blockquote>
    <h2>0.8.16</h2>
    <h2>New Features</h2>
    <ul>
    <li>JaCoCo now officially supports Java 27 (GitHub <a
    href="https://redirect.github.com/jacoco/jacoco/issues/2287">#2287</a>).</li>
    <li>Experimental support for Java 28 class files (GitHub <a
    href="https://redirect.github.com/jacoco/jacoco/issues/2170">#2170</a>,
    <a
    href="https://redirect.github.com/jacoco/jacoco/issues/2189">#2189</a>).</li>
    <li>To instrument classes loaded by the platform class loader,
    introduced in JDK 9 by JEP 261, the agent option
    <code>inclbootstrapclasses=true</code> is required (GitHub <a
    href="https://redirect.github.com/jacoco/jacoco/issues/2155">#2155</a>).</li>
    </ul>
    <h2>Non-functional Changes</h2>
    <ul>
    <li>JaCoCo now depends on ASM 9.11.1 (GitHub <a
    href="https://redirect.github.com/jacoco/jacoco/issues/2299">#2299</a>,
    <a
    href="https://redirect.github.com/jacoco/jacoco/issues/2304">#2304</a>).</li>
    </ul>
    </blockquote>
